            "detailed_description": "The gods have trapped your sister. Prove yourself worthy to bring her back. <br><br>Maui is a free action-adventure game based on Hawaiian mythology. The game features an innovative &quot;stat grid&quot; that lets you switch stats on the fly to face any situation. <br><br>Features: <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play the game completely for free--no microtransactions, no DLC, just a free game for you to play</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore a beautiful ancient Hawaiian island</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Innovative &quot;stat grid&quot; lets you switch character stats instantly at any time</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collect offerings and face trials from the gods</li></ul> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Narrative and mechanics drawn directly from Native Hawaiian culture and mythology</li></ul>",
